From f473594e6361ada503dd77dbec6270a584afaf3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: appkins <13772502+appkins@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Mar 2026 13:02:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 04/15] pci: brcmstb: add BCM2712 PCIe controller support

Extend the brcmstb PCIe driver with BCM2712 support including
64-bit address handling, MIP support, and RC BAR configuration
for the Raspberry Pi 5 PCIe controllers.

Link: https://github.com/sidero-community/u-boot
Signed-off-by: appkins <13772502+appkins@users.noreply.github.com>
[Regenerated against U-Boot v2026.04, then rebased onto v2026.10, from siderolabs/sbc-raspberrypi pull request 88:
 artifacts/u-boot/patches/0004-pci-brcmstb-add-BCM2712-PCIe-controller-support.patch.
 For v2026.10 cut down to the PCI IDs of the RP1: upstream has its own
 BCM2712 support in this driver.]
---
diff --git a/include/pci_ids.h b/include/pci_ids.h
index cfff275dab..6bc3abe4a9 100644
--- a/include/pci_ids.h
+++ b/include/pci_ids.h
@@ -2555,6 +2555,9 @@
 #define PCI_VENDOR_ID_TEKRAM		0x1de1
 #define PCI_DEVICE_ID_TEKRAM_DC290	0xdc29
 
+#define PCI_VENDOR_ID_RPI		0x1de4
+#define PCI_DEVICE_ID_RP1_C0		0x0001
+
 #define PCI_VENDOR_ID_TEHUTI		0x1fc9
 #define PCI_DEVICE_ID_TEHUTI_3009	0x3009
 #define PCI_DEVICE_ID_TEHUTI_3010	0x3010
